    "fabricationNotes": [
      "Feed J1 with a 1 V peak zero-offset sine from a function generator. Pin 1 is INPUT and pin 2 is GND.",
      "RP1 terminals 1 and 2 implement the modeled series rheostat. Leave terminal 3 unconnected. With power off, trim approximately 5 kΩ between terminals 1 and 2 for the nominal 50% example.",
      "Probe OUTPUT at C1 pad 1 or RLOAD pad 1 relative to GND with a high-impedance probe. Check package fit and fabricator rules before ordering."
    ]
  },
